Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.26,0:00:06.36,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is a third main tour final for Alexandra Eala.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N伊埃拉第三次闯入巡回赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.79,0:00:08.37,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}{\fs78}3{\fs68}局优势被追平
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.37,0:00:11.17,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}伊埃拉靠什么守住决赛门票？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.17,0:00:13.40,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}7{\fs68}日下午
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:17.06,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}她与萨卡里在香港展开{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘苦战
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.06,0:00:28.50,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, it's another rip-roaring forehand.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又是一记势大力沉的正手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.90,0:00:37.36,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Wide.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N出界了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.36,0:00:41.54,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sakkari loses the first set. Eala takes it 7-5.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N伊埃拉{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}赢下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.77,0:00:44.22,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}首盘{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.22,0:00:47.08,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}萨卡里在第二盘发出{\fs78}5{\fs68}记直接得分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.08,0:00:49.27,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}扳平盘分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.54,0:01:01.84,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, Eala won't give up yet.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N伊埃拉还不会放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.66,0:01:09.04,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And with a clench of the fist, eventually,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她握紧了拳头 终于
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:12.00,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Maria Sakkari has the second set on the board.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N玛丽亚 萨卡里拿下了第二盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.09,0:01:15.62,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}决胜盘 伊埃拉先冲到{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.62,0:01:17.64,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}萨卡里连追{\fs78}3{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.64,0:01:21.22,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}之后 这场比赛还要再争一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.54,0:01:33.80,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Magnificent!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太精彩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.90,0:01:37.64,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sakkari stranded. Eala with the pass.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N萨卡里被定住 伊埃拉穿越得手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.84,0:01:59.04,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sakkari was there and waiting.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N萨卡里早已等在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.32,0:02:01.94,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's completed the comeback.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她已经追了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:04.18,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Mustn't let that play on her mind.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不能让这一分影响自己的心态
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.94,0:02:13.76,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I think she's found the line.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我觉得这球压线了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.95,0:02:15.59,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}直接发球得分{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}12{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.59,0:02:17.78,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}伊埃拉却有{\fs78}45{\fs68}个制胜分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.78,0:02:20.04,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}非受迫失误比对手少{\fs78}7{\fs68}次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.04,0:02:22.08,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}总得分领先{\fs78}11{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.10,0:02:32.36,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sakkari saves it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N萨卡里化解了这个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.16,0:02:44.26,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is a third main tour final for Alexandra Eala.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N伊埃拉第三次闯入巡回赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.66,0:02:47.96,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She can barely believe it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她几乎不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.82,0:02:50.88,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Likewise this crowd on Centre Court.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N中心球场的观众也是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.38,0:02:56.18,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She has had some epic matches this week,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她这周经历了几场苦战
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.18,0:02:59.54,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and she's somehow coming out the right side.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但总能挺过来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.24,0:03:05.22,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a season this has been.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是多么精彩的一个赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.56,0:03:09.02,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Could it finish with a flourish?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N能否以漂亮的表现收官？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.64,0:03:11.84,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Could she be champion here in Hong Kong?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她能在香港夺冠吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.88,0:03:13.96,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}We'll find out tomorrow.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N答案明天揭晓
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:15.80,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She will be in the final.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她将出战决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.85,0:03:19.24,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}从{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}到连赢最后两局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.24,0:03:20.68,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}这样的关键分表现
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.68,0:03:23.64,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}能帮伊埃拉拿下香港冠军吗？
